guarantee: reducer: a stale Destroyed (not the current generation) is ignored
file: crates/voicen-core/src/overlay.rs
added_by: test-writer
--- old
        let gone = self.phase != WindowPhase::Absent && destroyed.contains(&self.generation);
--- new
